<title>PHILIPPINES: Ionics says Q3 net up 38.8 percent.</title>
<headline>Ionics says Q3 net up 38.8 percent.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third quarter ended September 30.</p>
<p>	    (in million pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Gross profit		    302.41 vs 239.549</p>
<p>    Net income			269.804 vs 194.446</p>
<p>Note: Full name Ionics Circuits Inc.</p>
